<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Burkina Faso to sell stake in SONACOR rice firm.</title>
<headline>Burkina Faso to sell stake in SONACOR rice firm.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government of Burkina Faso is to sell 62.85 percent of state rice firm Societe Nationale de Collecte et de Traitement du Riz (SONACOR), according to an advertisement in Ivory Coast's Fraternite-Matin newspaper.</p>
<p>It invited tenders for all or part of the stake by August 26 and said there were no restrictions as to the nationality of bidders.</p>
</text>
